                "widget": {
                    "title": "",
                    "text": {
                        "content": "## \u26a1 Latency & Performance SLO Monitor  `[v3.3-final \u2022 Complete Edition]`\nUnified multi-percentile latency curves (p50/p95/p99), horizontal SLO target lines, dual TTFT + E2E Heatmaps, and Per-Model Latency Table.\n\n**Suite Navigation:** 00 Usage Summary | 01 Fable 5 Deep-Dive | 02 Fleet Overview | **[03 Latency & SLOs]** | 04 Errors & Reliability | 05 Caching & FinOps | 06 Capacity & Quota  \n*Features: Multi-Dimensional Interactive Filters \u2022 Ratio Scorecards \u2022 Donut Shares \u2022 Dual-Axis Correlation \u2022 Live Data Tables \u2022 SRE/FinOps Playbooks*",
                        "format": "MARKDOWN",
                        "style": {
                            "backgroundColor": "#1A0A2E",
                            "textColor": "#E0E0E0",
                            "fontSize": "FS_MEDIUM",
                            "padding": "P_MEDIUM",
                            "horizontalAlignment": "H_LEFT",
                            "verticalAlignment": "V_CENTER"
                        }
                    }
                }
            },
            {
                "xPos": 0,
                "yPos": 5,
                "width": 48,
                "height": 4,
